  "date": "summer 0f 86",
  "content": "After getting the image of the emergency medical technicians working on me, I was transcending to a grey whitish light and started to travel through the tunnel. I was looking down the tunnel, which was transparent. I saw little black dots, I can only assume that these dots were nothing more than souls, these dots were everywhere and the cross over I can only compare it to the River Jordan when I got through the tunnel. I saw one of these dots coming at me and it grew very, very large. This huge massive silhouette told me to turn around this is not your time. So I turned around. I did not ask any more questions. I looked down again and saw the tiny little black dots, who were departed souls. I did not see any of my dead relatives. I do have a better understanding and consciousness of our relationships with our psychic nature, absolutely - and there is an afterlife.",
